@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam roundCorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteFontSize 9

title ST-04: SOC nhận cảnh báo → action → Core App (2026-10-05)

box "SOC Analyst" #D5E8D4
participant "SOC Analyst" as S
end box

box "Detection Engine" #FFF2CC
participant "Alerts API" as DE
participant "Actions API" as ACT
end box

box "Core App" #DAE8FC
participant "Internal API" as CA
database "core-db" as CDB
end box

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts**\n?status=open&risk_level=high
activate DE
DE -> DE : SELECT alerts WHERE status=open
DE --> S : **200 [{id, risk_level, created_at, ...}]**
deactivate DE

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts/{id}**
activate DE
DE -> DE : SELECT alert + login_attempt + risk_assessment
DE --> S : **200 {alert, context, reason_codes, ...}**
deactivate DE

note over S
  **SOC có thể thực hiện 4 action:**
  1. REQUIRE_MFA — Bắt buộc MFA lần tới
  2. REVOKE_SESSIONS — Thu hồi mọi phiên
  3. LOCK_USER — Khoá tài khoản (THỦ CÔNG)
  4. FORCE_LOGOUT — Buộc đăng xuất (THỦ CÔNG)
end note

== SOC takes action ==

S -> ACT : **POST /api/v1/alerts/{id}/actions**\n{action: "REVOKE_SESSIONS", reason: "attacker confirmed", severity: "high"}
activate ACT

ACT -> ACT : Validate analyst JWT + user_id
ACT -> CDB : **POST /api/v1/internal/actions**\n(action=REVOKE_SESSIONS,\ntarget_user_id, reason,\nidempotency_key, alert_id)
activate CA
activate CDB

CDB -> CDB : UPDATE sessions\nSET revoked_at=NOW()\nWHERE user_id=?\nAND revoked_at IS NULL
note right
  Sessions are revoked for THIS user only.
  Other users' sessions are untouched.
end note

CDB --> CA : **200 {status: applied,\ndetails: {sessions_revoked: 3}}**
deactivate CA
deactivate CDB

CA --> ACT : **200 {status: applied,\ndetails: {sessions_revoked: 3}}**
ACT --> S : **200 {status: applied,\ndetails: {sessions_revoked: 3}}**
deactivate ACT

S -> DE : **PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n{status: "acknowledged", notes}
activate DE
DE --> S : **200 {alert: {status: acknowledged}}**
deactivate DE

legend bottom
  **2026-10-05 changes:**
  - Every action returns {sessions_revoked: N}
  - REQUIRE_MFA now ALSO revokes sessions
  - LOCK_USER is manual-only (SOC decision, not auto-ML)
  - Idempotency: re-sending same action is safe (already_applied)
endlegend
@enduml
